.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt OSSL_TRACE_GET_CATEGORY_NUM 3ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm OSSL_trace_get_category_num ,
.Nm OSSL_trace_get_category_name
.Nd OpenSSL tracing information functions
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/trace.h
.Ft int
.Fo OSSL_trace_get_category_num
.Fa "const char *name"
.Fc
.Ft const char *
.Fo OSSL_trace_get_category_name
.Fa "int num"
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn OSSL_trace_get_category_num
gives the category number corresponding to the given
.Qo Li name Qc .
.Pp
.Fn OSSL_trace_get_category_name
gives the category name corresponding to the given
.Qo Li num Qc .
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Fn OSSL_trace_get_category_num
returns the category number if the given
.Qo Li name Qc
is a recognised category name, otherwise -1.
.Pp
.Fn OSSL_trace_get_category_name
returns the category name if the given
.Qo Li num Qc
is a recognised category number, otherwise NULL.
.Sh HISTORY
The OpenSSL Tracing API was added ino OpenSSL 3.0.
